message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "SINAC prenatal care and truncation of the gestational window"
abstract: >-
  How much the association between prenatal care and preterm birth in Mexico changes with the
  definition of the exposure and of the cohort, and how much of it truncation of the gestational
  window produces on its own. The code rebuilds the 2020-2023 live-birth records of the SINAC
  open data published by DGIS in an OMOP CDM v5.4 database, defines the cohorts in SQL with
  their attrition, and estimates crude and adjusted odds ratios for four prenatal-care measures
  against a null simulation. No record is distributed with the code.
